</gallery>
NRG is capable of firing highly radioactive energy beams through the vent in his containment suit. These blasts are strong enough to destroy large falling chunks of [[Galvan B (Classic)|Galvan B]],<ref name="SDP2">[[Showdown: Part 2]]</ref> harm strong opponents, such as [[Ultimate Kevin]],<ref name="AP1">[[Absolute Power: Part 1]]</ref> and even knock out an [[Orishan]].<ref name="THtH">''[[Too Hot to Handle]]''</ref> These beams can slice through objects, such as a glass container,<ref name="HS">''[[Hot Stretch]]''</ref> as well as easily shatter ice created by a [[Necrofriggian (Classic)|Necrofriggian]],<ref name="DoN">''[[Double or Nothing]]''</ref> melt the guns of [[Incursean (Classic)|Incurseans]],<ref name="SLATFATS">''[[So Long, and Thanks for All the Smoothies]]''</ref> and start fires.<ref>''[[It's a Mad, Mad, Mad Ben World: Part 2]]''</ref> This energy can also be found in his breath<ref name="HS" /> and saliva.<ref name="TMTC2">''[[The More Things Change: Part 2]]''</ref>

NRG is extremely hot by default within his suit,{{Refn|group = AP|name = NRG}} but he can amplify this heat and conduct it through his suit, making him so hot he can melt solid metal and rock just by touching it.{{Refn|''[[Ben 10 Ultimate Alien: Escape From Aggregor]]''; [[:File:EFA DVD NRG Data.png|file]]|group = DVD}} NRG has used this tactic to force Ultimate Kevin to release him, melt dirt below [[Gwen Tennyson (Classic)|Gwen]],<ref name="AP1" /> and attempt to burn the [[Trash Monster]];<ref name="TWG">''[[The Widening Gyre]]''</ref> while [[P'Andor]] used this tactic to burn [[Bivalvan]], completely melt an [[Aggrebot]],<ref name="EFA">''[[Escape From Aggregor]]''</ref> and to melt out of a frozen pool of water.<ref name="THtH" /> Additionally, NRG can radiate this heat from a short distance away, as he did to melt the concrete under [[Trombipulor]].<ref name="TP">''[[The Purge]]''</ref>

NRG's containment suit is very durable, as it was able to tank a crash from a [[Hover-Bus]] at full speed. NRG is also quite strong, being able to stop the aforementioned Hover-Bus,<ref name="TMTC2" /> throw a [[Vaxasaurian (Classic)|Vaxasaurian]] off his suit,<ref name="DoN" /> and fight on par with the Trash Monster.<ref name="TWG" />

NRG can survive underwater, as demonstrated by P'Andor.<ref name="THtH" />

NRG is immune to radiation<ref name="THtH" /><ref name="BA">''[[Ben Again]]''</ref> and being poisoned by lead.{{Refn|[[:File:NRG Lead Immunity.png]]|group = DJW}} NRG is also immune to being frozen due to the heat his body gives off, as demonstrated by P'Andor.<ref name="THtH" /> Additionally, NRG is immune to extreme heat. This was evidenced by [[Rook Blonko|Rook]] passing out due to the heat in the [[Kraaho]]'s lair, while NRG remained unaffected.<ref name="HS" />

Thanks to his containment suit, NRG is immune to the fire attacks of a [[Methanosian]],<ref name="DoN" /> the electricity attacks of a [[Cerebrocrustacean]],<ref name="AP1" /> and being possessed by a [[Lucubra]].<ref>''[[The Creature From Beyond]]''</ref> He can also break out of being trapped in ice easier thanks to his suit.<ref name="DoN" />

NRG is immune to being controlled by a [[Vladat]] via their [[Corruptura]]s by mimicking the radiation of a star.{{Refn|[[:File:NRG Corruptura Immunity.png]]|group = DJW}}

NRG can detect and track energy from long distances, as demonstrated by P'Andor.<ref name="THtH" />

===True Form===
<gallery type="slideshow">
Hot S67.png|Radioactive Energy Balls
