NRG is able to easily open his containment suit and get out whenever he wants to.{{Refn|[[:File:NRG Can Leave His Suit.png]]|group = MW}}<ref name="RMP">''[[Rad Monster Party]]''</ref> Outside of his containment suit, NRG can expel energy at a much higher level, being able to fire energy balls and blasts from his hands<ref name="HS" /> and fire beams of radioactive energy from his eyes, as demonstrated by [[Ultimate Aggregor]].<ref name="MoI">''[[Map of Infinity (Episode)|Map of Infinity]]''</ref>

NRG can absorb external sources of energy, such as electricity, an [[Aerophibian (Classic)|Aerophibian]]'s neuroshock blasts, and uranium. After absorbing energy, NRG becomes stronger<ref name="HS" /> and can grow in size, the latter was demonstrated by P'Andor.<ref name="THtH" />

NRG is capable of squashing and stretching his body to a certain degree{{Refn|group = AP|name = NRG}} and becoming intangible, both demonstrated by P'Andor.<ref name="THtH" /> NRG also has enhanced durability, as demonstrated when P'Andor was knocked through a wall by [[Kevin Levin (Classic)|Kevin]] throwing his containment suit at him.<ref name="THtH" />

After exiting his suit, NRG becomes incredibly agile and can fly extremely fast, he can also levitate.<ref name="THtH" /><ref name="HS"/><ref name="TFoW1">''[[The Frogs of War: Part 1]]''</ref>

NRG can make himself glow extremely bright, enough to harm [[Ectonurite (Classic)|Ectonurite]]s.<ref name="RMP">''[[Rad Monster Party]]''</ref>

==Weaknesses==
Due to the dangerous radiation his body gives off, NRG must stay in his suit for the safety of others and keep his radiation level to a minimum. There are, however, downsides to this, as NRG's containment suit weakens his output and completely removes several abilities, such as his agility, intangibility, and flight.<ref name="TFoW1"/>

NRG's radioactive blasts can be absorbed by the plasma generated by members of [[Ball Weevil]]'s [[Ball Weevil's Species|species]].<ref name="TRoAE">''[[The Rooters of All Evil]]''</ref>

NRG is vulnerable to carbon dampening rods because they slow down nuclear reactions, thereby inhibiting the radiation he generates, as demonstrated with P'Andor.<ref name="THtH" />

==History==
===Ultimate Alien===
*In ''[[Too Hot to Handle]]'', NRG's DNA was sampled and put in the [[Codon Stream]] when the [[Ultimatrix (Original)|Ultimatrix]] scanned [[P'Andor]]'s DNA.
*NRG first appeared in ''[[The Forge of Creation]]'', where he briefly fought 10-year-old [[Heatblast (Classic)|Heatblast]] until the latter reverted.
*In ''[[Absolute Power: Part 1]]'', NRG battled and was defeated by [[Ultimate Kevin]]. Later, NRG briefly battled [[Gwen Tennyson (Classic)|Gwen]] before switching into [[Nanomech]].
*In ''[[The Transmogrification of Eunice]]'', NRG battled and was defeated by [[Sunder]].
*In ''[[The Creature From Beyond]]'', NRG fought the [[Lucubra]] and created the pit Gwen needed to contain and send it back to [[Dagon's Dimension|where it belonged]].
*In ''[[The Purge]]'', NRG battled [[Trombipulor]], but failed to stop him from escaping due to [[Argit]]'s intervention. Later, NRG challenged [[Sir Driscoll]] to a duel.
*In ''[[Double or Nothing]]'', NRG freed himself from [[Fridge]]'s ice. Later, NRG fought [[Swamps]] and [[Hugh]] before switching into [[Spidermonkey (Classic)|Spidermonkey]].
*In ''[[The Widening Gyre]]'', NRG battled the [[Trash Monster]].
*In ''[[Night of the Living Nightmare]]'', NRG appeared twice in a dream. Firstly, [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] as NRG destroyed the [[Cassiopeian Dream Eater]]. Later, [[Albedo|Negative]] NRG failed to defeat Ben before switching into Negative [[Brainstorm]].

===Omniverse===
*In ''[[The More Things Change: Part 2]]'', NRG failed to catch [[Bubble Helmet]], [[Liam]], and [[Fistina]].
*In ''[[So Long, and Thanks for All the Smoothies]]'', NRG defeated the [[Incursean (Classic)|Incursean]]s.
*In ''[[Hot Stretch]]'', NRG stopped the [[Kraaho]] from destroying the [[Earth (Classic)|Earth]] with lava, during which his [[Prypiatosian-B Containment Suit|containment suit]] was opened and his true form was shown for the first time. He returned to the opened suit before the [[Omnitrix (Omniverse)|Omnitrix]] timed out.
*In ''[[Showdown: Part 2]]'', NRG helped defend [[Galvan Prime (Classic)|Galvan Prime]] from a meteor shower from the destroyed [[Galvan B (Classic)|Galvan B]].
*In ''[[Ben Again]]'', NRG was used by 11-year-old Ben in 16-year-old Ben's body to find coordinates in a reactor.
*In ''[[The Frogs of War: Part 1]]'', NRG accidentally set a building on fire and tried to calm the crowd of [[Human (Classic)|human]]s before the Omnitrix's randomizer function switched him into [[Waterhazard]].
*In ''[[Rad Monster Party]]'', NRG used his true form to make a very bright glow, which harmed [[Zs'Skayr]] due to the light.
*In ''[[A New Dawn]]'', NRG appeared for a short time when Ben was cycling through his aliens.

===Mad Ben's Timeline=== 
*In ''[[It's a Mad, Mad, Mad Ben World: Part 2]]'', [[Mad Ben|Mad]] NRG stopped the rebelling slaves.

